Read the same synchronous allocation ledger used for quota admission when rewriting the
slice HBM usage in npu-smi. The first patch's DCMI process-memory query is asynchronous and
can lag an allocation by several calls, which made npu-smi disagree with rtMemGetInfoEx and
the admission decision.

Apply after 0001-dsmi-get-hbm-info-slice-view.patch.

